WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.640
I'm Valeria. And I'm Camila. We're excited to share more about our two-headed life with you all.

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:09.560
Why are these conjoined twins facing backlash? Valeria and Camila are sisters who have grown

00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:13.860
quite the social media following. They are seemingly conjoined twins, claiming they have

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:19.840
one body and two hearts. So for the lungs, we actually have four. And for the tummies or

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:24.840
stomachs, we have two. They document their lives as conjoined twins, going to the gym together,

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:29.000
relaxing by the beach, and meeting up with friends. We can get drunk individually. Like,

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.500
I might be tipsy while she's sober.

00:00:30.620 --> 00:00:33.500
But we share one liver, so it processes the alcohol at the same rate.

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:35.000
We don't get drunk twice as fast.

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:38.720
But many users aren't convinced the sisters are actually conjoined twins.

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:44.560
Valeria and Camilla's posts are often flooded with people claiming their content is generated by artificial intelligence.

00:00:45.020 --> 00:00:48.540
And when some users leave comments asking if the images and videos are real,

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:51.060
oftentimes users respond saying they're not.

00:00:51.320 --> 00:00:56.440
Valeria and Camilla have seemingly tried to silence the doubters by posting pictures of them when they were younger.

00:00:56.440 --> 00:00:58.660
They have even addressed the doubters directly.

00:00:58.660 --> 00:01:01.640
responding to comments on their socials. One user asked,

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:05.020
does each of you control one half of your body? To which they responded with,

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:09.640
yes, we each control either the left or right side respectively. They also claimed they've

00:01:09.640 --> 00:01:14.460
had multiple surgeries due to their spines being dangerously conjoined. And the question they get

00:01:14.460 --> 00:01:18.740
asked the most is how they date, which they cleared up by saying, great question. So we

00:01:18.740 --> 00:01:23.060
actually like both men and women, but we both have to like the same person. We stop dating

00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:25.460
individually. It has to be a connection with all three of us.
